---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Septic Tank Repair Houston" description="Privacy policy for Septic Tank Repair Houston. How we collect, use, and protect your information." canonicalPath="/privacy/">
  <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px;">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> July 2025</p>
      <p>Septic Tank Repair Houston respects your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you use our website or services.</p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you fill out our contact form, we collect your name, email address, phone number, and any details about your septic service needs. We also collect standard web analytics data such as pages visited, browser type, and referral source.</p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your information to respond to your service requests, schedule appointments, and improve our website. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>Our website may use cookies for analytics purposes. You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>We take reasonable measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We may use third-party analytics services (such as Google Analytics) to understand website traffic. These services have their own privacy policies.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, contact us through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
